Use clean white and off-white backgrounds, deep navy or near-black technical sections, dark navy text, electric blue accents, cyan highlights, white text on dark sections, muted slate panels, optional lime-green micro accents, rounded cards, soft shadows, large typography, strong call-to-action sections, responsive grids, dashboard-style interface panels, metrics, workflow diagrams, system visuals, code-inspired cards, data-inspired graphics, and horizontal feature bands.

