Include the business name, a short business summary, main navigation links, service links, resource links, company links, contact details, social links or inactive social labels where necessary, a newsletter or signup area where appropriate, a contact call to action, copyright information, a Privacy link where appropriate, and a Terms link where appropriate.

### Footer Architecture

Separate the footer into clear content areas for company information, services, company navigation, resources or blog content, contact information, the consultation call to action, the newsletter or mini inquiry form, and legal information.

### Footer Link Rules

Every footer link must point to a real page, real archive, real page section, valid contact action, or safe non-navigating label when no destination can reasonably exist.

